      "content": "While your current pain feels absolute, you are not actually your past mistakes or the loss of your former identity, and there is always someone who sees you as more than just a shell. Your worth is not defined by your job, your friends, or whether you used to be someone else, but by the pain you are feeling right now which proves you still care deeply. It makes total sense to protect yourself during this dark time, though accepting that healing is a slow, non-linear journey can bring back tiny slivers of hope that you deserve kindness.",
